---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Service | Attirel"
  description="The terms that govern your use of the Attirel app and website, including accounts, acceptable use, fit recommendations, affiliate links, and liability."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-article px-5 py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-smoke">Last updated: July 15, 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">1. Agreement</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of the Attirel website (attirel.com)
          and the Attirel app (attirel.ai) (together, the "Service"). By using the Service you
          agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">2. The Service</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Attirel provides size recommendations, fit scores, and shopping tools based on the
          measurements and preferences you provide. Attirel is an independent service: we are
          not affiliated with, endorsed by, or responsible for the retailers and brands whose
          products appear in the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">3. Accounts</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          You must provide accurate information when creating an account and keep your
          credentials secure. You are responsible for activity on your account. You may delete
          your account at any time from the app's settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">4. Fit recommendations are estimates</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Fit scores, size recommendations, and confidence labels are estimates produced from
          the data available to us — your measurements, brand sizing data, and garment
          information. They are provided for guidance only and are not a guarantee that any
          product will fit. Always review the retailer's own product information before
          purchasing. Purchases are made from third-party retailers under their own terms,
          prices, and return policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">5. Affiliate links</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The Service contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission when you purchase
          through links on this site or in the app, at no additional cost to you. Commissions
          never influence fit scores or size recommendations, which are computed solely from
          measurement data. See our
          <a href="/about/#affiliate-disclosure" class="font-semibold text-plum underline-offset-2 hover:underline">affiliate disclosure</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">6. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">You agree not to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>use the Service for any unlawful purpose;</li>
          <li>scrape, harvest, or bulk-extract data from the Service;</li>
          <li>attempt to access other users' data or probe the Service's security;</li>
          <li>reverse engineer or resell the Service without our written permission;</li>
          <li>impersonate others or submit deliberately false information.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">7. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The Service — including its software, design, fit-scoring system, and content — is
          owned by Attirel and protected by applicable law. Product names, images, and
          trademarks of third-party brands belong to their respective owners and are used for
          identification only.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">8. Disclaimers</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The Service is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind,
          express or implied, including fitness for a particular purpose and non-infringement.
          We do not warrant that the Service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or that
          recommendations will meet your expectations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">9. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, Attirel shall not be liable for indirect,
          incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or for lost profits or data,
          arising from your use of the Service — including purchases that do not fit. Our total
          liability for any claim shall not exceed the greater of the amount you paid us in the
          twelve months before the claim or USD $50.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">10. Termination</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We may suspend or terminate access for violation of these Terms. You may stop using
          the Service and delete your account at any time. Sections 4–9 survive termination.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">11. Changes</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We may update these Terms from time to time. Material changes will be posted on this
          page with an updated date. Continued use after changes take effect constitutes
          acceptance.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">12. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Questions about these Terms: contact us via the app's support section or the email
          listed there.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
